# get_default_branch Tool responses

## retrieved_default

The default branch `{default_branch}` was retrieved. Make sure to use this as the default branch in all operations to GitHub.

## api_error

Could not retrieve the main/default branch via the GitHub API.

The error details:
raw_data: `{raw_data}`
error_details: `{error_details}`

## general_exception

There is some other reason, such as connectivity problems, for the error when trying to retrieve the main/default branch.
